| Repair candidate 8: 7 checks pass; same permissions    [Compare]   |
| [Keep v7 paused] [Test v8] -> [Approve v8]      [Rollback]          |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Every run provides a receipt with version, selected inputs, planned/actual effects, output link, status, and Undo when a checked inverse exists. Three clean supervised runs offer reduced prompting; the user chooses. New or repaired code starts supervised again. Authentication failures lead to key replacement, quota to waiting, and only code/data-shape failures to repair.

