plan/research/05-alt-builders.md:111:Meta currently documents `https://api.meta.ai/v1`, bearer API-key authentication, `muse-spark-1.3` and `muse-wonder-1.0`; Wonder is preview. Earlier guessed endpoints are unnecessary. **[verified: https://dev.meta.ai/docs/overview]** Meta recommends its Responses format for new agent loops and supports an OpenAI-compatible client against the Meta endpoint. That is Meta inference and billing, not an OpenAI model dependency. **[verified: https://dev.meta.ai/docs/protocols]**
