plan/research/01-product.md:152:| 4 | **Reshape an export CSV for an import** | Export CSV from tool A, open in Numbers or Sheets, delete columns, reorder, convert dates to ISO, split "Name" into first and last, save, import into tool B | "Drop a CSV here" action that applies the learned transform and writes `*_ready.csv`, with a before/after preview of the first 5 rows | K1 (droplet) | 10 to 20 min per run, plus errors avoided |
