```

Use acknowledged states: Recording, Observing metadata, Paused by you, Excluded, Permission needed, Stopped. An overlay badge can indicate build attention without replacing the capture label. Closing a window hides that window; Quit stops capture, triggers, model hosts, PTYs, and runs. Pause observation stops observation only; Stop all tools cancels tool process trees and disables triggers. Provide a separate Emergency stop for both.

