MVP Discoveries contains only Taught/Described drafts, with an honest empty state. Public v1 shows at most three new cards per week. Default system notification is off; offer one weekly review reminder. User-requested build approvals/failures are transactional, batched where possible. Avoid capture overlays narrating what the user is doing.

