510:### 4.3 `muse serve` hosting and protocol
512:Spawn the tested native Muse binary directly, bypassing its updating launcher. Do not bundle it. Current terms distinguish using outputs from incorporating downloadable materials, so redistribution needs explicit clearance rather than an optimistic assumption. [VERIFIED-docs: [Meta terms, section 1](https://dev.meta.ai/legal/terms-of-service).] Check installed path, signature, version, MSP version, and fingerprint; re-resolve only between jobs because the external launcher can remove old versions.
525:Use durable sessions, so omit `--no-session-log`. Durable logs contain synthetic build context only and follow the retention/deletion rules below. `session/start` selects `approvalMode:"promptUnmatched"`; the app independently rejects any request outside the build ceiling. Do not send exec's `on-request` string as an MSP enum. Disable the approval judge using a verified supported setting if available; **UNVERIFIED** for serve. If it cannot be disabled, it does not replace the app's policy or outer containment.
