plan/research/07-capture-windows.md:260:**[assumption]** Every PR runs Rust format/lint/build/unit tests on a pinned x64 Windows image, plus ARM64 compilation and native ARM tests where available. Test DTO serialization/replay, redaction geometry, source identity reuse, policy races, COM cleanup, error mapping, and packaging manifests. Run package install/OCR synthetic-image smoke tests where the runner permits them; an unsupported session is reported as infrastructure-unavailable, not a capture pass. Hosted runners are not evidence for consumer GPU, consent-dialog, border, UAC, or sleep/wake quality.
