plan/research/05-alt-builders.md:9:**[assumption]** Ship two artifact tiers. The default is a small typed workflow graph, rendered as understandable steps and executed by Macroscope's capability broker. Meta generates or repairs that graph. The advanced tier is actual code built by Muse Code in an isolated project, preferably controlled through MSP with a native product UI. An embedded terminal is a useful advanced view and fallback, not the default experience.
