plan/research/05-alt-builders.md:191:| `http.request(service, route, method, body) -> Json` | Exact origin/method/path templates, response limits, credential reference and declared data fields; validate redirects; block undeclared loopback/private destinations |
plan/research/05-alt-builders.md:192:| `browser.open/readTable/fill/click/download` | Profile, allowed origins, read versus act; semantic locators and expected page state; downloads restricted to granted root |
plan/research/05-alt-builders.md:208:**[assumption]** Start with manual button/hotkey, scheduled local time with IANA timezone, and file-created/changed within a selected root. Later add app-activated and explicitly opted-in clipboard-change triggers; do not continuously scan clipboard content by default. Event payloads carry opaque file/tab handles, not unrestricted paths. Every trigger has debounce, concurrency=1, maximum runtime and a missed-run policy. UI workflows wait for an unlocked active session; schedules do not imply permission to control an unattended desktop.
