952:These are workload estimates, not measured Muse costs. Reminder/child calls, repeated context, failed attempts, and missing usage can exceed them. The $19/month proposal analyzes every episode; the $43 option uploads many images; the $32 model assumes daily/nightly/weekly analysis. Those are rejected workloads, not arithmetic alternatives for the same design. No-cache heavy scenario—16 builds at $4 plus four repairs at $1.50—already exceeds $70 before observation.
