+| **Keep 1: deterministic retained tools; no runtime model/computer control** | Accepted | Preserved §§0, 1.3, 4.1 and 7; each retained run remains local/deterministic, with arbitrary scripts, runtime LLMs and browser acting outside MVP. |
+| **Keep 2: deliberate teaching before ambient discovery, honest sample and denial paths** | Accepted | Preserved the direction and strengthened it to Tell-first. Show remains later, sample stays explicitly prebuilt, and denial continues to Tell; discovery has no cold-start dependency. |
+| **Keep 3: confirmed business rules and independent oracles** | Accepted | Preserved §§1.2, 2 and 7.4; independent expected output, private fixture comparison and user rule questions remain prerequisites. Strengthened oracle isolation from generated imports. |
+| **Keep 4: app-owned API key and API billing; no consumer workaround** | Accepted | Preserved §4.5 auth lanes and shared-store prohibition. Rejected-key ingestion evidence remains valid; only successful inference/billing identity remains open. Probe 21 does not erase probes A/B. |
+| **Keep 5: Standard Spark/Wonder and bounded context** | Accepted | Preserved §4.1 routes and packet limits. No Wonder Full subscription route, speculative SDK/base URL, huge screenshot context, local-model exception or Contributor mode introduced. |
+| **Keep 6: private HOME, shell-off, no shared auth mutation, zero-tool fallback** | Accepted | Preserved and strengthened §§4.3–4.5 with explicit admission/confinement failure decisions; terminal convenience never waives them. |
+| **Keep 7: broker effects, immutable versions, reviewed repair and crash uncertainty** | Accepted | Preserved §§3.2 and 7; strengthened per-run byte binding. Repair/undo are later features with their authority/uncertain-write restrictions retained, not silently automated. |
+| **Keep 8: acknowledged permission barriers, visible observation and gaps** | Accepted | Preserved §5 as a separately gated feature; no keyboard monitoring, clipboard polling, audio, or synthetic inferred actions added. |
